<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Plastika SKK 40.869 mln 9mo net.</title>
<headline>Slovak Plastika SKK 40.869 mln 9mo net.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for nine-month period ending September 30, 1996: (in million crowns)</p>
<p> After-tax profit		  40.869		  90.743</p>
<p> Operating revenues	   1,370.056	     1,459.581</p>
<p> Operating costs		1,273.990	     1,294.389</p>
<p> Operating profit		  96.066		 165.192</p>
<p>Profit from regular</p>
<p>  activities			 42.887		  89.283</p>
<p> Total loans			163.879		 112.259</p>
<p> Long-term loans		    4.053		  12.259</p>
<p> Short-term loans		 159.826		 100.000</p>
<p> Basic capital		    692.750		 692.750</p>
<p> Total Assets		   1,345.264	     1,325.876</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Plastika a.s.. Results are provided by the Bratislava Stock Exchange. Plastika is the country's leading producer of plastic piping systems and foils. It exports about 60 percent of its production.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3688</p>
